<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN SERIE A RELEGATION PLAYOFF IN NAPLES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN SERIE A RELEGATION PLAYOFF IN NAPLES.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN, Italy 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The serie A relegation playoff between Cagliari and Piacenza will be played in Naples on Sunday, June 15, the Italian soccer league decided on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Both teams finished the season level on points with Perugia, who were relegated under complex rules.</p>
<p>The match must be played at a neutral venue.</p>
</text>
